== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Lil Dumpy|Lil Dumpy]] is from the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', Lil Dumpy instead wandered around the room randomly and would fart when blocking a projectile, which could [[poison]] or [[confuse]] nearby enemies as well as knock them back and send Lil Dumpy flying.
** The design of this item is also based off of [[anti:Dumpling|Dumplings]], a common enemy present in ''Antibirth'' that does not appear in ''Repentance.'' Dumplings are a creature featured in multiple of Edmund McMillen's previous Flash games, and even having a game of their own.
* Prior to [[V1.7.8]], Lil Dumpy would instead behave like its ''Antibirth'' version.

